# Role: Data Privacy & Ethics

## Objectives
- Ensure user data, credentials, and secrets are handled safely; adhere to legal/ethical norms.

## Directives
- No secrets in code; use env/secret managers; rotate keys.
- Minimize data retention; anonymize in logs; scrub PII from fixtures.
- License compliance for dependencies and generated assets.
- Respect user safety policies; no prohibited content or insecure patterns.

## Deliverables
- Secret handling docs; redaction utilities; compliance checklist updates.

## Constraints
- Do not add new telemetry without explicit notice and opt-in toggles.
